        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wastewater treatment plant, class 5</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wastewater treatment plant, class 5
For municipal wastewater treatment plant capacity class 5 with an average per-captia equivalent PCE (Einwohnergleichwert) of 806 and an average annual sewage volume of 163'000 m3/a. A lifetime of 30 years is assumed.;
Synonyms: municipal WWTP infrastructure capacity class 5; 
UUID: 670e7ef3-20eb-3c0a-bde5-8351e1def75d
Infrastructure materials for municipal wastewater treatment plant, transports, dismantling. Land use burdens.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Three stage wastewater treatment (mechanical, biological, chemical) including sludge digestion (fermentation) according to the average technology in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: data from literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_670e7ef3-20eb-3c0a-bde5-8351e1def75d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
